FIX Simple Binary Encoding
--------------------------

src/fix_sbe/schema/*.yaml, src/fix_sbe/datamodel/, project/ and
docs/schema/ model the message schema of FIX Simple Binary Encoding (SBE),
Version 1.0 and Version 2.0 Release Candidate 3, by FIX Protocol Limited
(FIX Trading Community):
https://github.com/FIXTradingCommunity/fix-simple-binary-encoding. They are
this project's work, written in its own words. They are not FIX Protocol
Limited's, and their use does not imply endorsement by FIX Protocol Limited.
"FIX", "FIX Protocol" and "FIX Trading Community" are marks of FIX Protocol
Limited, used here to identify the standard.

FIX Protocol Limited licenses the specification and its XSDs under the
Creative Commons Attribution-NoDerivatives 4.0 International Public License
(CC BY-ND 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nd/4.0/legalcode).
That licence lets anyone copy and share the work unchanged, with credit and
a link to the licence. It does not let anyone share an adapted version.

upstream/fix-simple-binary-encoding/ therefore holds these files whole and
unchanged, each matched by git object hash in scripts/upstream_pins.tsv:

  (c) Copyright 2014-2017 FIX Protocol Limited, under CC BY-ND 4.0:
    v1-0-STANDARD/resources/sbe.xsd
    v1-0-STANDARD/resources/Examples.xml
    at the tag v1.0-errata-Nov-2020, commit 6321e6b.

  (c) Copyright 2014-2019 FIX Protocol Limited, under CC BY-ND 4.0:
    v2-0-RC3/resources/xsd/sbe-2.0rc3.xsd
    v2-0-RC3/resources/xml/examples.xml
