Knowledge bundle
----------------

This product maintains its documentation as a Linked Open Knowledge Format
(LOKF) bundle under .lokf/: https://lokf.nolan-nichols.com/specification/

LOKF is a semantic profile of the Open Knowledge Format (OKF) specification
by Google Cloud Platform:
https://github.com/GoogleCloudPlatform/open-knowledge-format/blob/main/SPEC.md

The scripts under .lokf/scripts/ and .lokf/m365/ and the
knowledge-librarian, knowledge-registrar, knowledge-release and
knowledge-sync workflows under .github/workflows/ are copies of the
ktl-sidecar templates in knowledge-trust-ladder
(https://github.com/noelmcloughlin/knowledge-trust-ladder). The site under
website/ and the knowledge-website workflow derive from the ktl-website
templates in the same repository, and website/NOTICE lists the part
adapted from the LOKF toolkit's site. All of them are licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0.
